Unikey Input Method for X-Window / Wayland
Copyright (C) 2004 Pham Kim Long
==========================================

Bo go tieng Viet UniKey. Ban goc 1.0.4 (2006) chi co XIM server cho X11;
ban nay bo sung cac front-end hien dai de chay duoc tren desktop Wayland
ma khong can ibus-unikey hay fcitx5-unikey.

Thanh phan
----------

  Front-end hien dai (moi):
    ibus-engine-unikey       IBus engine. Hien trong Settings -> Keyboard
                             -> Input Sources. Cach dung duoc khuyen nghi.
    im-unikey.so             Module GTK3
    libim-unikey.so          Module GTK4
    libunikeyplatform...so   Plugin Qt6

  Dung chung:
    ukbridge                 Toan bo logic go tieng Viet cua cac
                             front-end moi

Kien truc va ly do thiet ke:   doc/STANDALONE.md


1. Yeu cau
----------

Bat buoc:
    build-essential pkg-config

Tuy front-end muon build (configure tu bo qua cai nao thieu thu vien):
    ibus libibus-1.0-dev                 IBus engine  <- can cai neu muon
                                                         hien trong Settings
    libgtk-3-dev                         module GTK3
    libgtk-4-dev                         module GTK4
    qt6-base-dev qt6-base-private-dev    plugin Qt6

Cai het tren Ubuntu/Debian:

    sudo apt install build-essential pkg-config \
        ibus libibus-1.0-dev \
        libgtk-3-dev libgtk-4-dev \
        qt6-base-dev qt6-base-private-dev

Luu y: plugin Qt CAN qt6-base-private-dev, vi QPlatformInputContext la API
private cua Qt. Thieu goi nay thi configure bo qua plugin Qt.


2. Build
--------

    ./configure
    make
    make check

Tren trinh bien dich moi (gcc >= 14) can them co, vi vai cach viet trong ma
nguon 2006 nay da thanh loi:

    ./configure CFLAGS="-O2 -std=gnu17" \
                CXXFLAGS="-O2 -Wno-narrowing -include cstring -include cstdlib"
    make

  -std=gnu17         gcc mac dinh C23, bien implicit declaration thanh loi
  -Wno-narrowing     bang charset trong vnconv nhoi '\xNN' vao mang
                     unsigned char; cat bit van ra dung, chi la C++11 bao loi
  -include cstring   vai file goi strchr/strlen ma dua vao transitive include
  -include cstdlib   khong con nua

Cuoi buoc configure se in ra front-end nao duoc build, vi du:

    checking for ibus-1.0 >= 1.5... yes
    checking for gtk+-3.0 >= 3.22... yes
    checking for gtk4 >= 4.6... yes
    checking for Qt6Gui >= 6.2... yes

Neu sua Makefile.am hay configure.ac thi phai chay lai:

    autoreconf -i

`make check` chay hai bo test, khong can man hinh:
    src/ukbridge/test-bridge     logic go tieng Viet (Telex/VNI/VIQR,
                                 backspace, trang thai dung chung)
    src/unikey-qt/test-plugin    plugin Qt nap duoc va tao input context


3. Cai dat
----------

Co hai cach. CHI DUNG MOT, dung ca hai se de lai file mo coi.

3.a Goi .deb (khuyen nghi)

    ./make-deb.sh
    sudo dpkg -i release/x-unikey_*.deb

    Cai vao /usr, do dpkg quan ly, go sach bang:
        sudo apt remove x-unikey

3.b Cai bang tay

    sudo ./install-standalone.sh          # go: sudo ./install-standalone.sh remove

    Cai vao /usr/local, khong qua dpkg. Tien khi dang phat trien.

CHUYEN TU 3.b SANG 3.a: phai go ban cai tay TRUOC, vi hai ben dung chung
duong dan cho module GTK/Qt nhung khac duong dan cho engine -- cai .deb de
len se bo lai /usr/local/libexec/ibus-engine-unikey mo coi:

    sudo ./install-standalone.sh remove
    sudo dpkg -i release/x-unikey_*.deb
    ibus restart

Neu desktop con hien cua so XIM cu `TX: UTF8`, do la `/usr/local/bin/unikey`
duoc mot file autostart cu khoi dong, khong phai UI cua IBus engine. Don rieng
ba artifact cu, nhung giu `~/.unikey` cho engine moi:

    # chay tu cay ma nguon x-unikey
    sudo ./install-standalone.sh cleanup-legacy


4. Dung: qua Settings (khuyen nghi)
-----------------------------------

    1. Dang xuat roi dang nhap lai.

       BUOC NAY BAT BUOC neu ban vua cai ibus lan dau. gnome-shell chi do
       va khoi dong ibus MOT LAN luc phien bat dau; chay `ibus-daemon` bang
       tay khong thay the duoc. Trieu chung khi bo qua buoc nay:
       `ibus list-engine` liet ke duoc "unikey" nhung Settings khong thay gi.

    2. Settings -> Keyboard -> Input Sources -> + -> Vietnamese
       -> "Vietnamese (UniKey)"

    3. Chuyen bo go bang Super-Space.

Cach nay khong can bien moi truong nao, co chi bao tren thanh tren cung, va
go duoc vao ca VSCode / ung dung Electron / ung dung GTK4 Wayland -- nhung
app ma module toolkit khong voi toi duoc (xem doc/STANDALONE.md muc 6).

4.a Cau hinh
-------------

Mo menu `VN` tren thanh IBus, chon `Cai dat...`; hoac bam Preferences cua
Vietnamese (UniKey) trong IBus/Settings. Cua so chi chay khi duoc mo, khong co
tray/status window va khong tu khoi dong cung desktop.

Co the chon Telex/VNI/VIQR/kieu tu dinh nghia, TerminalMode Off/Preedit,
dat dau tu do, kieu dat dau, kiem tra chinh ta, tu khoi phuc tu ngoai, macro
va keymap rieng. Bang ma hien dai co dinh la Unicode (UTF-8): IBus/Wayland
khong the commit an toan byte TCVN/VNI legacy.

DIRECT/PREEDIT/OFF la che do tu dong theo tung o nhap, khong phai cong tac
toan cuc. Cau hinh duoc ghi nguyen tu vao `~/.unikey/options`, giu ban cu dau
tien o `~/.unikey/options.bak`. Kieu go va trang thai bat/tat co hieu luc ngay;
cac tuy chon tinh (TerminalMode, dat dau, spell-check, macro) co hieu luc sau
`ibus restart` hoac sau khi khoi dong lai ung dung dung module GTK/Qt.


5. Dung: module toolkit (khi khong co ibus)
-------------------------------------------

Dat cac bien sau (install-standalone.sh da ghi san vao
~/.config/environment.d/unikey.conf) roi dang nhap lai:

    GTK_IM_MODULE=unikey
    QT_IM_MODULE=unikey
    XMODIFIERS=@im=unikey

Thu ngay khong can dang xuat:

    GTK_IM_MODULE=unikey gedit                 # GTK3
    GTK_IM_MODULE=unikey gnome-text-editor     # GTK4


6. Hai che do go
----------------

DIRECT
    Commit thang tung ky tu, sua dau bang delete-surrounding-text.
    Giong UniKey tren Windows: khong gach chan, khong co trang thai
    "dang go do".

PREEDIT
    Am tiet dang go nam trong vung preedit, chua vao van ban that.
    Trong terminal IBus no khong co gach chan, nhin nhu chu thuong nhung
    khong can VTE xoa lai van ban da commit.

IBus engine chon che do theo input purpose cua tung o nhap:

    password/PIN          -> OFF
    purpose=TERMINAL      -> theo TerminalMode       (gnome-terminal/VTE)
    purpose=URL + surrounding -> DIRECT               (Chromium address bar)
    Firefox FREE_FORM+h0x40->h0+surrounding -> DIRECT  (mozAwesomebar handshake)
    moi context con lai   -> PREEDIT trong suot       (web, app, VS Code/xterm.js)

`IBUS_CAP_SURROUNDING_TEXT` chi noi rang client co mot buffer protocol, khong
chung minh buffer do la van ban nguoi dung dang sua. VS Code/xterm.js la phan
vi du: textarea an cua Chromium bao caps=0x29 va purpose=FREE_FORM, nhung thao
tac delete/commit tren no duoc xterm.js bien thanh byte gui vao PTY. Vi khong co
app-id hay purpose de nhan ra terminal nay, IBus khong tu chon DIRECT tu caps.
Ngoai le hep la thanh dia chi: day la buffer that. Engine doi den khi
surrounding-text duoc xac nhan roi dung DIRECT, nen van go duoc tieng Viet de
search ma khong hien composition/predict. Chromium gui purpose=URL roi co the
tam tra ve FREE_FORM; engine giu co URL den het phien focus. Firefox dung
`inputmode=mozAwesomebar` ma GTK hien chua map sang URL. Engine chi confirm khi
thay du chuoi metadata FREE_FORM + UPPERCASE_SENTENCES-only (0x40) roi NONE
trong cung mot focus. Mot hint 0x40/0x41 don le van PREEDIT, vi input/textarea
web cung dung autocapitalize/spellcheck va tung gay replace sai nhu `đangắng`.
Handshake cung phai xong truoc phim nhap dau tien. Neu nguoi dung da bat dau go
(trace o chat Codex cho thay app co the gui NONE rat muon), context bi latch
PREEDIT den focus-out va khong duoc doi sang DIRECT giua cau.
Surrounding van bat buoc, con password/terminal duoc uu tien truoc. Chi
FREE_FORM + surrounding van khong du de bat DIRECT, de giu an toan cho terminal.

Module GTK3/GTK4/Qt luon dung PREEDIT: chung khong hien thuc callback xoa.

IBus publish preedit bang `PREEDIT_CLEAR` va la ben duy nhat commit no. Khi het
tu, engine dung `HidePreeditText -> CommitText`, cung cach IBus Mozc ket thuc
composition. Khong con phat hai trang thai trung gian CommitText + preedit cu
(co the lam Firefox/Electron replace nham thanh `đangắng`) hoac empty-preedit +
CommitText (xterm.js co the finalize hai lan thanh `chưa chưa`).

CAC CACH KHONG AN TOAN, dung lam lai:

  1. DIRECT o moi noi bang delete-surrounding-text.
     VTE co the lo di lenh xoa; VS Code/xterm.js co surrounding-text cua
     textarea an chu khong phai buffer shell. Ket qua la chu cu khong duoc thay
     dung cach hoac ca tu bi gui lai. IBus vi vay dung PREEDIT.

  2. Chi thay lenh xoa bang forward_key_event(BackSpace), con chu moi van
     commit_text.
     Phim forward di vao hang doi su kien cua toolkit, con commit_text ap
     thang vao widget -- khong bao dam thu tu, HONG CA TRINH DUYET.

  3. Tin caps=0x29 la mot editable buffer.
     Day co the la gia tri tam cua IBus GTK, hoac buffer phu cua Chromium.
     Capability nay khong du de bat DIRECT.

Trong che do DIRECT, ky tu thuong cung phai TU COMMIT chu khong tra ve cho
ung dung tu chen: neu khong, ky tu di duong su kien ban phim con lenh xoa di
duong input-method, va khi go nhanh se dao thu tu ("đấy" ra "đâdấyd").

Client khai purpose=TERMINAL thi ton trong `TerminalMode`:

    TerminalMode = Off       # mac dinh: tat bo go trong terminal
    TerminalMode = Preedit   # go tieng Viet, khong gach chan

VS Code hien khong khai purpose TERMINAL, nen tu dong dung PREEDIT an toan bat
ke option nay.

Go roi: touch ~/.unikey/debug && ibus restart
        cat ~/.unikey/debug.log        (in instance, focus, purpose, caps, mode)

Smoke test VTE sau khi cai engine moi va `ibus restart`:

    python3 src/unikey-ibus/vte-smoke.py --terminal-mode off
    python3 src/unikey-ibus/vte-smoke.py --terminal-mode preedit


7. Phim tat
-----------

    Ctrl-Shift          bat/tat tieng Viet
    Ctrl-Shift-F5..F8   Telex / VNI / VIQR / kieu tu dinh nghia
    Ctrl-Shift-Z        tat spell-check cho tu ke tiep (go tat: HDDQT, BDD)
    Ctrl-Shift-Esc      tra lai phim da go

Khi dung qua ibus, Super-Space cua GNOME va Ctrl-Shift la hai cong tac doc
lap: Ctrl-Shift tat tieng Viet ben trong engine nhung chi bao tren thanh
tren cung van hien VN.

    Cau hinh:             menu VN -> Cai dat...; file ~/.unikey/options
    Trang thai bat/tat:   ~/.unikey/state    (dong bo giua cac ung dung)
    Macro, kieu go rieng: xem doc/keymap-syntax, doc/im-samples/, doc/ukmacro


8. Giay phep
------------

